#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:10
msgid "Explicit motor and axis control"
msgstr "显式电机与轴控制"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:12
msgid ""
"Select `Nexus::MotorControl` for the independent C11 current-control kernel "
"and `Nexus::AxisControl` for command admission and rotary axis control. Each"
" caller owns its state, parameters, execution context and time facts. These "
"components do not allocate, schedule work, read a clock or initialize a "
"peripheral."
msgstr ""
"选择 `Nexus::MotorControl` 使用独立的 C11 电流控制核，选择 `Nexus::AxisControl` "
"实现命令准入与旋转轴控制。每个调用者拥有自己的状态、参数、执行上下文和时间事实。组件不分配内存、不调度工作、不读取时钟，也不初始化外设。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:17
msgid ""
"Current, voltage, mechanical angle and velocity use explicitly named SI "
"units. Motor pole pairs, encoder scaling and mechanical transmission are "
"different facts. Keep parameter publication separate from live IRQ "
"computation; ordinary structure copies do not provide cross-context "
"synchronization."
msgstr ""
"电流、电压、机械角和速度使用名称中明确标注的 SI 单位。电机极对数、编码器缩放和机械传动是不同事实。参数发布与运行中的 IRQ "
"计算分开处理；普通结构体复制不提供跨上下文同步。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:22
msgid ""
"An axis decision adopts a software reference. A motor result is an output "
"plan. Neither establishes hardware adoption, physical position or a safe "
"electrical state. The selected provider owns actual PWM/ADC transitions and "
"final request, buffer and callback withdrawal. Failed withdrawal retains "
"that ownership even after outputs have been inhibited."
msgstr ""
"轴控制决策采用的是软件参考，电机计算结果是输出计划。两者均不证明硬件已采用、实际位置或电气安全状态。选定 provider 负责实际 PWM／ADC "
"状态变化，以及请求、缓冲区和回调引用的最终撤回。即使输出已被抑制，撤回失败仍保留这些所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:28
msgid ""
"The [control component boundary](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/control/README.md) and "
"[control composition guide](../../../guides/control-and-smart-devices.md) "
"explain how external products provide scheduling, hardware bindings and "
"recovery."
msgstr ""
"[控制组件边界](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/control/README.md)和[控制组合指南](../../../guides/control-and-"
"smart-devices.md)说明外部产品如何提供调度、硬件绑定及恢复策略。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:32
msgid "Preserve explicit control and stopping policy"
msgstr "保留显式控制与停止策略"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:34
msgid ""
"Axis commands retain the original local receipt, complete identity and "
"finite authority. Repeated/old sequences do not renew it; accepting a "
"command does not adopt it until a later valid step. Feedback carries its "
"mechanical side and observation interval. Position trajectory completion and"
" measured target settling remain separate results."
msgstr ""
"轴命令保留原始本地接收时间、完整身份和有期限的授权。重复或旧序号不会续期；命令被接纳后，要到后续有效 step "
"才会采用。反馈携带机械侧和观察区间。位置轨迹计算完成与测得目标已稳定保持为独立结果。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:40
msgid ""
"`NX_AXIS_INHIBIT_AFTER_DWELL` ends the selected software decision after "
"observed zero-speed dwell. `NX_AXIS_HOLD_ZERO_VELOCITY` enters "
"`NX_AXIS_HOLDING` and keeps the zero-velocity PI running while refusing new "
"motion. Holding is not proof of load support, fixed position or mechanical "
"safety. The product first completes its mechanical handoff, then disables "
"and separately withdraws actual hardware. Invalid feedback cannot be "
"repaired by retaining a previous holding output."
msgstr ""
"`NX_AXIS_INHIBIT_AFTER_DWELL` "
"在观察到零速停留满足要求后结束所选软件决策。`NX_AXIS_HOLD_ZERO_VELOCITY` 进入 "
"`NX_AXIS_HOLDING`，继续运行零速 PI "
"并拒绝新运动。保持状态不证明负载已被支撑、位置固定或机械安全。产品先完成机械交接，再禁能并单独撤回实际硬件。保留上一次保持输出不能修复无效反馈。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:47
msgid ""
"Motor computation uses calibrated A/V/rad/rad/s with a shared microsecond "
"domain and 64-bit epoch. It distinguishes the declared sample event, angle "
"observation, control observation and planned apply boundary. Backward angle "
"projection and output prediction have separate bounded spans. A sequential "
"ADC bridge must qualify its sampling skew instead of claiming simultaneous "
"measurements."
msgstr ""
"电机计算使用经过标定的 A／V／rad／rad/s，以及共享的微秒时间域和 64 位 "
"epoch。声明的采样事件、角度观察、控制观察和计划采用边界分别表达。向过去时刻投影角度与向输出时刻预测各自具有有界时间跨度。顺序 ADC "
"桥接必须验证其采样偏斜，不能声称同时测量。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:53
msgid ""
"The complete duty plan and `planned_voltage` are not a measured voltage "
"receipt. `nx_motor_track_voltage` feeds final quantization/window limitation"
" back once for the matching latest cycle. A hardware commit error must close"
" kernel admission and follow the real provider's withdrawal; resetting a C "
"object cannot join IRQs."
msgstr ""
"完整占空比计划和 `planned_voltage` 不代表实测电压回执。`nx_motor_track_voltage` "
"只对匹配的最新周期回馈一次最终量化／窗口限制。硬件提交错误必须关闭控制核准入，并按真实 provider 的合同撤回；重置 C 对象不能会合 IRQ。"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:58
msgid "Motor computation"
msgstr "电机计算"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/reference/api/components/control.md:60
msgid "Caller-owned sensored PMSM calculation and offset candidates."
msgstr "由调用者拥有的有感 PMSM 计算与偏置候选。"

